- fixed the clean installer’s stale reference to the intentionally absent `agent.md`;
- added lifecycle and tracked/ignored-state regressions.

## Root cause

The repository tracked a machine-local pointer while future run directories were ignored. The committed pointer named `pr176-final-review-20260720`, but that directory was absent in a clean clone, so validation followed the pointer and crashed on a missing `RUN_PLAN.json`.

